# The build context is copied wholesale into the builder stage. Two things in
# here would be actively wrong to ship: a local pb_data, which is somebody's
# real database including NATS seeds, and pb_public, which the ui stage rebuilds
# and would otherwise be overwritten by a stale local copy anyway.
.git
.github
pb_data
pb_public
ui/node_modules
ui/dist
nats-config
storage

stone-age
stone-age.exe
stone-age-authz-test*
leaf-sync
leaf-sync.exe

.claude
*.log
*.md
